  "content": "**查看我的其他资源包！**\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/rainbows-3d-mace\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Op0pojUo/de1eba66a759ae5dd6059c9c5b2fc6fd4b18364f_96.webp\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/rainbows-3d-trident\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/r6fvlh3S/277c6abd5f000a9d49a2beeb71be2eed1cd30e0b_96.webp\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/pyrofish-texturepack\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/kmlTU9hm/2165cedac86d3ac045b4b67bd3dcc561eea388a0.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/lava-chicken-vanilla-backport\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Wb9IBuRl/adfa0c4bb37431de52d5f360cab4da5cf9ead673.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n\n\n## 📥 安装方法\n\n将其放入资源包文件夹，并在游戏中激活即可。\n\n嘿，热爱精美资源包的 Minecraft 玩家们！\n隆重介绍彩虹 3D 钓鱼竿——这是一款完全 3D 建模的资源包，将原版 2D 钓鱼竿替换为酷炫、立体且时尚的版本。\n![预览](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a5a8b6ee935f88406e2263745609bbe412b66cd4.png)\n## \n**允许在整合包中使用此资源包。**\n\n**即将更新！**\n\n**画廊展示了它的实际效果！欢迎反馈。 <3**",
